{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38431","headline":"即席十韵 · 吴融","name":"即席十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"住处方窥宋，平生未嫁卢。\n暖金轻铸骨，寒玉细凝肤。\n妬蜨长成伴，伤鸾耐得孤。\n城堪迷下蔡，台合上姑苏。\n弄眼难降柳，含茸欲鬬蒲。\n生凉云母扇，直夜博山炉。\n翡翠交妆镜，鸳鸯入画图。\n无心同石转，有泪约泉枯。\n猨渴应须见，鹰饥秪待呼。\n银河正清浅，霓节过来无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38431.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38431","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}